    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d777">

                <pb facs="0741" n="729" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg729"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00114A European War 1939/186: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé at Tangier</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Childs</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tangier</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-01-02T21:00:00+01:00">January 2, 1943—9
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received January 2—7:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>8. My 922, December 30.<anchor n="15" xml:id="d777-f1"/> Major Bernadoni<anchor
                        n="16" xml:id="d777-f2"/> was informed today by the officer in Tetuán in
                    charge of our internees that orders had <pb facs="0742" n="730" xml:id="pg730"/>
                    been received for the sending of 17 of them to Madrid by a plane which had
                    arrived for that purpose. It was added the 17 are to be turned over to our
                    Embassy in Madrid for repatriation. The 17 include 9 officers at Melilla and the
                    ranking officer at Xauen who will be the first to be sent to Madrid by the plane
                    which can only carry 10 at a time. Departure will depend upon the weather.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Madrid.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Childs</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d777-f1" n="15" xml:id="d777-f1-content">
